tps://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1327505932765311_5286460740341237931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xJJmIZSt80QQ7kNvwEmzWKK&_nc_oc=Adqh3pTq6FhwAoeTBLKLD_T4aWiqr9JazZKj-IoLDjvqOOGgeMXK4BgrChMLVrljTTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAO60UNwdEEcX5CaVNt6dTE8JH-0geWm49LNtl-VfdLlg&oe=6A5F62E4"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (33).png", "id": "2076724189787348", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_2076724193120681_4871879008737988130_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2O2XMgzUmq4Q7kNvwHs2dV5&_nc_oc=AdqJwbW6LHMmunIVcLX6oboiDe7om0Tb3WCrUlEWJBiO9-MExNQX-Ht424gcMyhkRWc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCSUNOi0cjD23gsbKTvmoCcS6erbkXER00VUGtGkPqbAw&oe=6A5F7657"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00033.png", "id": "3932380693732122", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_3932380697065455_5087597325838508038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vEWGcBDqq3gQ7kNvwGLYA1G&_nc_oc=AdqLFl7KxK_LR7_Rq2ecclHZlVCHMsiiuhD9bR-8pTo1PMlneIakmvB3oYwdkvI_FKg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAWqEvJUnzs0PDy8p851aQpRNOBechvGlA9jStbjOoJNw&oe=6A5F5522"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (34).png", "id": "890620570035576", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_890620573368909_3665044860292886222_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6p7tcC-1u_QQ7kNvwFdn7a4&_nc_oc=AdoSrwEK0F6Mvvn_nWauITk8AyTyGE1vfl0iq6MeD2ZsXqQOuZIjmQ-jd4aDPTGRxIU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDxyzkdWpg8LTdsBxtl4V2RunKN-mACbug839oDaQ8dKQ&oe=6A5F885B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zbonk_PvP_KeyArt_2560x1440.png", "id": "1447771853958450", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310734_1447771857291783_6843326067876927809_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YWMaf9sOTqsQ7kNvwHwRQMm&_nc_oc=AdrXquRYbeP4QWkbg8AxifYQ6D6QMBYNJWJIpmnwaJtDNUrXg1X3BxnuWFeR8PFDpuQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAVjPKeOJSS5IP1m2yOTT40Z-gNeGe8TxAqigBO1hra_Q&oe=6A5F6635"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating